.Dd September 28, 2026
.Dt FLAPPY 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm flappy
.Nd simple front-end for the FLAPPY package manager
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm install
.Op Ar options
.Ar package ...
.Nm
.Cm remove
.Op Ar options
.Ar package ...
.Nm
.Cm update
.Nm
.Cm upgrade
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
wraps
.Xr flappy-install 1
and
.Xr flappy-remove 1
behind four commands.
Any extra options are passed through to the underlying tool.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm install Ar package ...
Sync the repository indexes, then install the packages
.Pq Nm flappy-install Fl S .
.It Cm remove Ar package ...
Remove the packages
.Pq Nm flappy-remove .
.It Cm update
Sync the repository indexes
.Pq Nm flappy-install Fl S .
.It Cm upgrade
Sync the repository indexes and upgrade all installed packages
.Pq Nm flappy-install Fl Su .
If the
.Sy flappy
package itself needs updating it is updated first and the upgrade is retried.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr flappy-install 1 ,
.Xr flappy-remove 1 ,
.Xr flappy-query 1 ,
.Xr flappy.d 5
